    <string name="wl_howto_title">How it gets to Cardmarket</string>
    <string name="wl_howto">Cardmarket\'s API is closed to new applicants and the Shopping Wizard cannot be driven by a URL. What does work is the decklist paste field:\n\n1. Copy the list with the button above.\n2. Open \"Buying → My Wants → Add Decklist\" at Cardmarket.\n3. Paste one block per wants list – the export is already grouped by minimum condition and chunked to 150 entries, which is Cardmarket\'s limit per list.\n4. Set the minimum condition once for the list, then start the Shopping Wizard from there.\n\nPinned printings are exported with their expansion. The collector number is deliberately left out: Cardmarket\'s \"(V.1)\" is a version counter within an expansion, not a collector number.</string>
